e exponent into a product of smaller exponents. For example,\n\n$$\n{6}^{6}={6}^{2}\\cdot {6}^{2}\\cdot {6}^{2}.\n$$\n\nNext, we note the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{6}^{2} & ≡36\\, & (\\text{mod}\\,8) \\\\  & ≡4\\cdot 8+4\\, & (\\text{mod}\\,8) \\\\  & ≡4\\cdot 0+4\\, & (\\text{mod}\\,8) \\\\  & ≡4\\, & (\\text{mod}\\,8)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, by the multiplicative property of congruences, we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{6}^{6} & ≡{6}^{2}\\cdot {6}^{2}\\cdot {6}^{2}\\, & (\\text{mod}\\,8) \\\\  & ≡4\\cdot 4\\cdot 4\\, & (\\text{mod}\\,8) \\\\  & ≡64\\, & (\\text{mod}\\,8) \\\\  & ≡8\\cdot 8+0\\, & (\\text{mod}\\,8) \\\\  & ≡8\\cdot 0+0\\, & (\\text{mod}\\,8) \\\\  & ≡0\\, & (\\text{mod}\\,8)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n{6}^{6}≡0\\,\\,(\\text{mod}\\,8).\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-73c85ead-eecb-5b52-b908-fbc0204c2c1e"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-73c85ead-eecb-5b52-b908-fbc0204c2c1e" :answer-field/id #uuid "73c85ead-eecb-5b52-b908-fbc0204c2c1e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-4ff97b5a-aa26-5386-8610-53fd3f7e47a4" :answer-field/choices ["answer-4ff97b5a-aa26-5386-8610-53fd3f7e47a4" "answer-d45499bb-6b7d-582e-97b1-44d94a4e45b5" "answer-007485a3-ad3a-5793-ac33-de29999bf9ea" "answer-51c72491-04d8-53e7-bd93-4d1d93e3e157" "answer-72adad8b-3fc8-5add-a319-a9ec180a9b45"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4ff97b5a-aa26-5386-8610-53fd3f7e47a4" :answer/id #uuid "4ff97b5a-aa26-5386-8610-53fd3f7e47a4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0\\,(\\text{mod}\\,8)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d45499bb-6b7d-582e-97b1-44d94a4e45b5" :answer/id #uuid "d45499bb-6b7d-582e-97b1-44d94a4e45b5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\,(\\text{mod}\\,8)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-007485a3-ad3a-5793-